WEBVTT

00:21:28.958 --> 00:21:30.643
the children, the bosses,

00:21:30.667 --> 00:21:32.726
the big brother
versus the younger brother,

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.684
the one who entered the family business
before the other, et cetera,

00:21:36.708 --> 00:21:40.434
you could create a set of expectations

00:21:40.458 --> 00:21:43.750
what you're going to trust for what.

00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:46.393
Think that in this moment,

00:21:46.417 --> 00:21:48.809
where things are
much more fluid and diffused,

00:21:48.833 --> 00:21:52.059
and we need to define all of that,

00:21:52.083 --> 00:21:55.726
trust has become a major centerpiece.

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:57.684
You know, there's a lot of restlessness

00:21:57.708 --> 00:22:01.268
in the realm of relationships
at this moment, at work as well.